'''Advice to Goh!''' (Japanese: '''ゴウにライバル！？ミュウへの道！！''' ''A Rival for {{tt|Go|Goh}}!? The Road to Mew!!'') is the twentieth chapter of the {{ma|Pokémon Journeys}} manga. It is based on the [[JN068|animated series episode by the same name]].

==Plot==
{{Incomplete plot}}

==Major events==
* {{an|Professor Oak}} tells {{Ash}} and [[Goh]] about [[Project Mew]], a research project aiming to find {{an|Mew}}.
* Ash reunites with {{Gary}}, who is later revealed to be taking part in Project Mew.
* Ash, Goh, and Gary battle a {{pkmn2|wild}} {{p|Moltres}}.
* Goh accepts Professor Oak's recommendation for Project Mew.

